WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.335
Welcome to Foundation of Sketch.

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:05.023
Not sure where to start?

00:00:05.023 --> 00:00:06.672
You're in the right place.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:12.974
We'll begin with simple lines and shapes, building a steady hand and a strong drawing foundation.

00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:15.229
Explore form and texture.

00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:19.365
Discover how light and shadow bring everyday objects to life.

00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:25.783
Step by step, you'll work toward landscapes and portraits, with more control and confidence.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:27.587
You don't need experience.

00:00:27.587 --> 00:00:31.788
Just a pencil, a little curiosity, and a willingness to try.

00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:34.134
Let's start drawing, and have fun.
